8. settleExpired for channel queries: settle expired reservations of that channel — need to find expired RESERVED reservations by channel. ChannelReservationRepository.listReservedByChannel gives channel reservations still RESERVED; then for each, lock main reservation by id and expireIfDue. That works: expireIfDue checks main reservation status & expiry.

